{"item_id": "BM0720", "position": 720, "batch": "2026-11-25_kc-c2_31", "anon_id": "M-31-001", "kind": "solve-compute", "role": "C2", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "status": "computed", "r_code": "post_unnorm <- function(d) (1/(2*d)) * (1/2)\nZ <- integrate(post_unnorm, 0.5, 2)$value\nM <- integrate(function(d) d * post_unnorm(d), 0.5, 2)$value\nanswer <- M / Z", "answer_expression": "", "test_inputs": [], "correct_options": [], "note": "The likelihood is 1/(2*delta) for delta >= 0.5, so the posterior is proportional to 1/delta on [0.5, 2]; its mean is 1.5/ln 4."}
{"item_id": "BM0721", "position": 721, "batch": "2026-11-25_kc-c2_31", "anon_id": "M-31-002", "kind": "solve-compute", "role": "C2", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "status": "computed", "r_code": "answer <- 2.5 + qt(0.975, 28) * 0.4", "answer_expression": "", "test_inputs": [], "correct_options": [], "note": "Upper bound = estimate + t(0.975, 28) * SE."}
