{"item_id": "BM0728", "position": 728, "batch": "2026-11-25_kc-c2_31", "anon_id": "M-31-009", "kind": "solve-compute", "role": "C2", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "status": "computed", "r_code": "n <- 12; p <- 0.15\nev <- 0\nfor (d in 0:n) {\n  pd <- dbinom(d, n, p)\n  p0 <- choose(n - d, 2) / choose(n, 2)\n  p1 <- d * (n - d) / choose(n, 2)\n  p2 <- choose(d, 2) / choose(n, 2)\n  g <- 60*p0 + 15*p1 - 30*p2 + ifelse(d %% 2 == 0, -12, 8)\n  ev <- ev + pd * g\n}\nanswer <- ev", "answer_expression": "", "test_inputs": [], "correct_options": [], "note": "Conditions on D, uses hypergeometric draw probabilities and the parity fee or rebate, then averages over the binomial distribution."}
